Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（192，173）\1c&H18C8F3&}地心空洞某处
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.73,0:05:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在人类文明的进程中\N{\fnArial\fs30}For most of human civilization, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们普遍认为 人类是地球上最具优势的物种\N{\fnArial\fs30}we believed that we were Earth's most dominant species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.31,0:05:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为只有在地球表面 生命才能存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believed that life… could only exist on the surface of the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.78,0:05:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但过了某个时候 你不禁会思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, after a certain point, you have to wonder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos（73，183）\an4\1c&HF0F0F0&}艾琳·安德鲁斯博士\N帝王组织 金刚研究部主任
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.05,0:05:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类还对什么有误解\N{\fnArial\fs30}what else were we wrong about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:20.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（涡旋 地心空洞核心）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.29,0:05:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对于地心空洞的测绘不到5%\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have mapped less than five percent of Hollow Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但地心和地表的生态系统紧密关联超乎想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}But our ecosystems are linked in ways we never could have imagined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个世界不是独立的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not two separate worlds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.79,0:05:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是个整体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.45,0:05:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,金刚还在适应新环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kong is settling in to Hollow Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:41.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约时报 金刚迁居地心空洞）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说 大块头挺喜欢它新家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the big guy likes his new home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.00,0:05:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的种群热衷于群居\N{\fnArial\fs30}His species was a very social one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.61,0:05:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,独自生活和它的天性不符\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not natural for Kong to be so alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它没有同类\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the last of his kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.20,0:05:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一天都在寻找家人 尽管只是徒劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day he searches for a family that he'll never find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那哥斯拉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Godzilla?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉在地表 金刚在地下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla's on the surface, Kong is below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要它们不闯入彼此的领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as they don't venture into each other's territories, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没什么好担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've got nothing to worry about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humanity is lucky…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.95,0:06:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打不了的仗 总有哥斯拉帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla's fighting the battles we can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.83,0:06:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（86，278）\1c&H33D0DB&}意大利 罗马
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.73,0:06:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16}根据日本东宝株式会社的形象「哥斯拉」改编
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉大战金刚2：帝国崛起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些批评人士指责\N{\fnArial\fs30}With some critics calling out Monarch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.33,0:07:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝王组织将数十亿美元税款\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the billions in taxpayer dollars…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（192，223）\1c&H26D4DF&}帝王组织1号前哨站 金刚观测点 地心空洞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.76,0:07:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,用于研究地心空洞和机密技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}going to Hollow Earth and classified technologies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.58,0:07:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如神秘的动力室项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the mysterious Project Powerhouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.15,0:07:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们邀请到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here to discuss, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝王组织的艾琳·安德鲁斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monarch's own, Doctor Ilene Andrews.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.08,0:07:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,先来聊聊哥斯拉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's start with Godzilla. He stopped the attack in Rome, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.95,0:07:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为罗马而战后 它一直待在城里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stopped the attack in Rome, but he's still in the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.14,0:07:54.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（哥斯拉占据罗马斗兽场 游客心生敬畏纷纷撤离）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.85,0:07:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样安全吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we be worried?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我们要知道一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's clear to us now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.10,0:07:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉在保护我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Godzilla is a Titan who protects us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.48,0:07:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,免遭其它泰坦巨兽的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}from other malicious Titan threats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,金刚要去睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kong's heading in for the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.65,0:08:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它今天又不顺心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it was another rough one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.28,0:08:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,它还没走过那么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the farthest he's gone yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许它在找对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he was looking for a date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝它好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望它能跟别的物种谈个恋爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope he's up for some interspecies romance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,第五区发现沉洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sinkhole detected in Sector Five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.08,0:08:15.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（第五区检测到地震活动）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是金刚的狩猎场\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Kong's hunting ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:24.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发现未知区域）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在闪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. It keeps doing that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是电波异常吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}More electrical anomalies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不是 我还没遇到过这种状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I don't think so, man. I haven't seen anything like this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找汉普顿主任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we should tell Director Hampton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.18,0:08:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我去上报 这地方本身就不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll type it up. This whole place is an anomaly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.37,0:08:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,太奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.25,0:09:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\1c&H28C8DC&}地心空洞入口 帝王组织 巴巴多斯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.43,0:09:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉意大利军方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the Italian military{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是有哥斯拉 罗马早就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rome would be flattened if it weren't for Godzilla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.13,0:09:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们爱怎么威胁就怎么威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can threaten him all they want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.03,0:09:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们另找替罪羊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell them to find another scapegoat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.49,0:09:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉普顿主任 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Director Hampton, what's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 1号前哨站麻烦不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Outpost One is still a nightmare, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.43,0:09:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发来了这个 你来看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they sent this over. I thought you might want to take a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.77,0:09:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是传感器阵列的数据吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this from the sensor array?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.33,0:09:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 上面有了一些很奇怪的峰值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we've been getting some pretty weird spikes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能是普通的干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it could just be regular interference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一直持续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but it keeps happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该组个调查队 以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should prep a survey team just in case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about Godzilla?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.77,0:09:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它还在睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's still sleeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.43,0:09:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,像个愤怒的巨婴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a big angry baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.59,0:09:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望它能一直这样安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope it stays that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.17,0:09:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\1c&H28C8DC&}帝王组织基地学院 巴巴多斯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家专心答题 明白吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, eyes on your own paper, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.65,0:09:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你认为正确的选项圈出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make sure we circle the answers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.05,0:09:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要清晰\N{\fnArial\fs30}really, really clearly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.68,0:10:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,务必预留出足够的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}[muffled speaking]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.30,0:10:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.50,0:10:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的女儿很聪明 但不够专心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your daughter is intelligent, but she's not engaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,成绩一直在下滑 也不和别的小朋友玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her grades are slipping, she's not interacting with any of her friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.12,0:10:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些问题不会凭空消失 安德鲁斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these problems aren't going away, Doctor Andrews.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.95,0:10:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been getting worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:10:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 真是抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.73,0:10:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还在适应我们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just still adjusting to our world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但学校里面还有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we have a number of students{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.47,0:11:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离了自己文化的学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are culturally displaced and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但她不是 她就是自己文化的代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, but her culture's not displaced, she is her culture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.63,0:11:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是伊维族的最后一位幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the last living member of the Iwi tribe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是想帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just trying to reach her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.83,0:11:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我何尝不是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.10,0:11:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}就是担心金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}你为什么画了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.47,0:11:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}可以走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}我不属于这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.60,0:11:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}我不属于任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.07,0:11:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}你应该在我身边
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:11:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}我也应该在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.29,0:12:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.12,0:12:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,几百年来 伊维族人一直守护着骷髅岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}For centuries, the Iwi tribe were the guardians of Skull Island, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里也是金刚的老家\N{\fnArial\fs30}the ancestral home of the great Kong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.52,0:12:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但风暴规律变化摧毁了这座岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when shifting storm patterns destroyed the island, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.42,0:12:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊维族惨遭灭族 只有一个人逃过了这场劫难\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Iwi were annihilated… with only a single member of the tribe having survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A young girl…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,被人们在肆虐的暴风雨中救了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}found and rescued amid the punishing storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.05,0:12:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的族人们则被大水吞没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her fellow villagers were lost to the tides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.55,0:12:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐入历史洪流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone to history, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像金刚的同类那般\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like the great Kongs themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.19,0:12:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊维族的一大特点是他们没有口头语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Iwi were unique… in the sense that they had no spoken language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:44.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（地表声波 地震纵波 地震横波）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.15,0:13:00.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（无信号）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.55,0:13:05.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（接近传感器警报 监测到活动）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.33,0:13:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}我担心自己出了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.89,0:13:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}你没有任何问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.60,0:13:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}你很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}我感觉自己快疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.08,0:13:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定会有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna figure this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.68,0:13:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（94，220）\1c&H33D0DB&}佛罗里达州 迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:13:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次巨兽来袭时你会在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where will you be when the next Titan attacks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.74,0:14:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要如何保护自己珍视的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will you protect the things and people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.51,0:14:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,人和物\N{\fnArial\fs30}that matter most to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,本期播客由巨人保险赞助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today's podcast is brought to you by Gargantua insurance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.01,0:14:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一为你们的家和个人财物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only insurance company that provides Titan protection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,提供巨大保护的保险公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your home and personal belongings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为哥斯拉不会在乎你们的希望和梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Godzilla may not care about your hopes and dreams, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但巨人保险在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Gargantua does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.36,0:14:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的各位 巨兽的真相的听众朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Titan truthers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.03,0:14:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在今天的节目里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we have got a lot…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.16,0:14:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要揭开很多秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}to unpack on today's show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.96,0:14:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在录节目呢 快走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recording in progress, go away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.36,0:14:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我只是想告诉大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yes. I just want to let everyone know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.03,0:14:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实根本没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that there is no…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.79,0:14:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要宰了这人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.03,0:14:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是服了 干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable! What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.69,0:14:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Bernie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾琳·安德鲁斯 我们在香港见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilene Andrews, we met in Hong Kong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.06,0:14:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对对对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Oh. Yeah, yeah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.69,0:14:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,香港 那是很久之前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hong Kong. Yeah, that was so long ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no, God, uh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.36,0:14:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前头发长一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was when my hair was longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.26,0:14:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前 你剪短了头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cut your hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.93,0:14:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挑染了 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Highlights too, it's nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.79,0:14:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想 能不能请你帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wondering if I could get your help with something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.06,0:15:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.95,0:15:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 进来吧 安德鲁斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, yeah. Of course, yeah. Come on in, Doctor Andrews.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.43,0:15:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.11,0:15:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.43,0:15:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着走廊走 然后左拐 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just straight down that hall there. To the left. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.55,0:15:13.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（谢绝上门推销 别找借口）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.09,0:15:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你点什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I help you with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.67,0:15:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,（西班牙语）随意一点 别拘束\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, mi casa es su home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.51,0:15:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看右边的序列\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sequence on the right, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.71,0:15:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个信号一直在干扰地心空洞里的设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is a signal that's been interfering with our equipment in Hollow Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. And, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些画 是我女儿吉雅画出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these are drawings by my daughter, Jia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.04,0:15:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会觉得我精神不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna think that I'm completely insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 中间部分的图案一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the patterns are the same in the middle section.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.04,0:15:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.54,0:15:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.81,0:15:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 我们的分析员毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, our analysts, they don't know what to make of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.61,0:15:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还一直兜圈子 说是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're talking in circles, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.28,0:15:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,无线电干扰 纯属巧合 但我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're saying "radio interference, " "coincidence, " but I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.04,0:15:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的思维异于常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that you think outside of the box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.44,0:15:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在不知道该找谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know who else to turn to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们派你来 是因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they sent you here because…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没人派我来 是我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no one sent me. I came here on my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这也太讽刺了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that's what's ironic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.64,0:15:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝王组织不肯承认我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Monarch wouldn't confirm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.84,0:16:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁机械哥斯拉过程中的作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}my crucial part in taking down Mechagodzilla, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,害我损失了几千\N{\fnArial\fs30}which cost me thousands of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.28,0:16:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,几百名个人播客的粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}hundreds of subscribers on my blog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问 还有喷子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and the trolls…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.98,0:16:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,网上那些喷子\N{\fnArial\fs30}the trolls online, they question{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管发什么 他们都会喷\N{\fnArial\fs30}every single thing that I put up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.61,0:16:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是 有这么个喷子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially this one troll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.91,0:16:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,网名叫基多拉斯坦64 你听说过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one troll named ghidorastan64. You ever heard of him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.88,0:16:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我从来没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.65,0:16:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 因为他就是个人渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, because he's a trash bag, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.71,0:16:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这次来是为了 我敢说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm more qualified than half of those people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.91,0:16:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比你一半的手下都更有资质\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you have working over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.78,0:16:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比帝王组织的任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew what Godzilla was going to do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.11,0:16:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,都更早知道 哥斯拉要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}before anybody at Monarch said…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才来找你 伯尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I am here, Bernie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.79,0:16:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找你了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am here. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help me or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}That depends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.33,0:16:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是帝心站的新老大吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the new boss down at the Mess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.69,0:16:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么站\N{\fnArial\fs30}The what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.43,0:16:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝王组织地心空洞观测站 帝心站\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Monarch Hollow Earth Station. The MHES, the Mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, nobody calls it that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.33,0:16:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我负责金刚研究部 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I run the Kong research division but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.99,0:16:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来说 整体管理是由汉普顿主任负责的\N{\fnArial\fs30}technically Director Hampton is in charge of general operations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.93,0:16:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她没有一个可以和金刚交流的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Director Hampton doesn't have a kid who can talk to Kong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.93,0:16:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想去地心空洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go to Hollow Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:17:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用我自己说 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so glad I didn't have to say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.13,0:17:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还以为你不会邀请我呢 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you were never gonna ask - No, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.29,0:17:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在邀请你 我确实需要证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking. but I really do need proof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.55,0:17:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以帮我提升播客的可信度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that would help me with my bona fides for my blog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.46,0:17:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 你一定会帮我实现愿望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I knew that you would be the person to help me do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.09,0:17:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 真能去的话 这也不太可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Well, if this happens, and that is a big if, then Monarch would need{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.30,0:17:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝王组织会要你所有作品的最终剪辑权\N{\fnArial\fs30}then Monarch would need, you know, whatever you guys call it. Final cut on anything in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:13.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（帝王组织紧急警报）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.99,0:17:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 最终剪辑权 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. I'm sorry, final cut? No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:15.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巨兽警报 哥斯拉的生命体征指数飙升 请求指示）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会毁掉我报道的可信度 优秀的记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that will destroy my journalistic integrity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.13,0:17:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.73,0:17:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会交出最终剪辑权的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No really true, good documentarian gives final cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.99,0:17:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以让你当制片人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could make you a producer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.29,0:17:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 行 最终剪辑权归你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay! Fine! Final cut! Final cut! Fine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.86,0:17:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我女儿出了点问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, something is happening to my daughter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.45,0:17:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不知道该怎么解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have no idea how to fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.49,0:17:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你能帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You work out what's going on, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.84,0:17:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以满足你的任何要求 这样行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will get you anything that you want, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.44,0:17:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.64,0:17:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个承诺有点空泛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, anything is a lot, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 但是很大方 但我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's very generous, but I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了 就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have to go. Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.31,0:17:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉又开始活动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla is on the move again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.10,0:18:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 听我说 如果哥斯拉活动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.45,0:18:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那它一定是感受到了威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Godzilla's on the move, he senses a threat coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.79,0:18:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但具体的我们还不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.75,0:18:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不担心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're not concerned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当然担心 参议员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we're concerned, Senator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.20,0:18:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们一直在监测全局\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're monitoring the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果监测到哥斯拉朝金刚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monitor the fact that if Godzilla heads…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你先 有一点可以确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? You just… And I am telling you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.55,0:18:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a problem!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.60,0:18:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议员…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.79,0:18:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,金刚不会离开地心空洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Kong doesn't leave Hollow Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.80,0:18:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以哥斯拉也就没有理由 还击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why Godzilla has no reason to retaliate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.43,0:19:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,它怎么上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing up here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.49,0:19:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.40,0:19:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉知道了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, does Godzilla know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.36,0:19:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that we can tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.55,0:19:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它迟早会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, it's only a matter of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.60,0:19:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果哥斯拉开始往这边来了该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what happens if Godzilla starts heading this way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.30,0:19:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们只能拼命跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we all run like hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.89,0:19:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 快跟上 快 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, let's go! Keep it up. Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}它受伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.88,0:19:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇静剂已就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sedatives in place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.74,0:19:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好消息是 只是牙齿发炎\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, the good news is it's just an infected tooth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:20:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的是 你们找来了最好的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But luckily, you've come to the best doctor in town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ I gotcha ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}♪ I gotcha ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.28,0:20:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 金刚完全睡过去了 生命体征稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Kong sedation at a 100%. Vitals stable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.64,0:20:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,特雷普 你现在可以下去换掉它的坏牙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trapper, you are clear to swap the damaged tooth with replacement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.94,0:20:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,特雷普已着陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touchdown, Trapper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 早餐吃什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Fella. What'd you have for breakfast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.43,0:20:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这颗烂牙要出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this sucker's ready to come out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 开始拔\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's roll!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.73,0:21:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,特雷普 谢谢你这么快赶过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trapper. Thanks for getting down here so fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.23,0:21:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意为您效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are most welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.19,0:21:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬进90米高的巨猿嘴里可是件稀罕事 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not every day you get to climb inside a 300-foot ape's mouth, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.19,0:21:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.99,0:21:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定那东西够坚硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're sure it's gonna be strong enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.53,0:21:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那颗牙吗 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tooth? Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,和汽车隔热板用的是同一种聚合物复合材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the same polymer composite they use on the vehicle heat shields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.79,0:21:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它都能咬断埃菲尔铁塔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could chomp through the Eiffel Tower with that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.13,0:21:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是哥斯拉知道它在这里 牙再硬也没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good teeth aren't gonna help if Godzilla senses that he's up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.19,0:21:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.09,0:21:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让泰坦巨兽牙疼多不像话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't have a Titan with a toothache, can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.15,0:21:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.98,0:21:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 它可能会头晕个几小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. Couple of hours he might be a bit groggy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.71,0:21:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不影响回到地下\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he'll be good to go back down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.56,0:21:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最开始听说你要当兽医时 心想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when I first heard that you were gonna be a vet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.78,0:22:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那对特雷普来说太无聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought no. That is way too boring for Trapper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.30,0:22:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果你成了全世界最另类的兽医\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you go and become the weirdest vet in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.41,0:22:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我和杜立德医生一样厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's basically me and Doctor Dolittle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.58,0:22:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我的病人个头更大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except my animals are bigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.34,0:22:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为 终于有人让他成熟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought finally, someone has made him grow up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.18,0:22:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.14,0:22:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,大学里有人试过 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone tried that back in college, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.44,0:22:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}didn't really work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.48,0:22:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.14,0:22:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 她当时和我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what was it she said to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.48,0:22:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,特雷普 你这人 太吊儿郎当了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Trapper, you are not a serious person."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.08,0:22:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个聪明人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she sounds very smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.64,0:22:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.68,0:22:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有个博士学位\N{\fnArial\fs30}ish. She got a PhD.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.01,0:22:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the kid doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.81,0:22:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 她很挣扎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know. Struggling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.74,0:22:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在努力适应这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to find her place in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.31,0:22:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know how that goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.98,0:22:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 她没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, she'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.08,0:22:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有个好妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got a good mum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.17,0:22:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}好好休息
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.15,0:22:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}你会好起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.16,0:22:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}你看起来状态不错
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.26,0:23:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德鲁斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor Andrews.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.89,0:23:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.89,0:23:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,客人一直在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}guest has been asking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.26,0:23:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可千万别误会我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't take this the wrong way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.66,0:23:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}but can I just say, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.63,0:23:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的研究资料库里面有很多明显的疏漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your research library has many glaring omissions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.93,0:23:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,害得我找了好几个贴吧好友帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to call in some serious favors from my Discord chat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.87,0:23:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不 伯尼 你有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were not… Bernie, do you have something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.19,0:23:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 我有发现 我确实有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I've got something. I do have something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.69,0:23:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现你们监测到的信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever signal you guys are picking up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.59,0:23:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在以类似的模式不断地重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay, we have seen similar patterns repeating over time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.19,0:23:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个峰值都对应一次泰坦巨兽事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}And each spike corresponds with a specific Titan event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.89,0:23:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮我拿一下吗 多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hold this, please? Thank you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.03,0:23:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.29,0:23:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}See this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.29,0:23:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,王者基多拉 首次与哥斯拉相遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}King Ghidorah, huh? First encounter with Godzilla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.63,0:23:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 发现了骷髅岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, uh, discovery of Skull Island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.96,0:23:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你是说这些信号不是无缘无故形成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. So what you're saying is that these signals aren't just random patterns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.96,0:23:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 应该是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it seems that way, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.00,0:23:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉也收到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Godzilla's picking up on it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.26,0:23:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止如此 我查看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I can do you one better. Now, look, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.10,0:23:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个波形图中的相似点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've looked at points of similarities{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.10,0:23:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后与信号进行了对比\N{\fnArial\fs30}in each wave form and I compared them to that pattern, and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.05,0:23:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯尼 你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bernie, what are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.90,0:23:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种求救信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a distress call!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.73,0:23:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是求救信号 用心理能量发出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a distress call. A psychic energy SOS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.70,0:23:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你女儿看到了这些符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if your daughter is seeing these symbols, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.89,0:23:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说明下面有东西 正在呼救\N{\fnArial\fs30}then something down there is calling for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.76,0:23:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通的声波传播这么远后 音质一定会衰减\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regular soundwaves, they can't propagate this far without decay. This?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.83,0:24:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从来没遇到过这种信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is something that we have never encountered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且它还在变强\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's getting stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.18,0:24:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有理论支持吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a working theory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.21,0:24:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种外星的心灵感应语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, telepathic alien language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.58,0:24:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是某种求救信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's some sort of distress signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.71,0:24:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号 什么发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signal? From what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.34,0:24:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是人发出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or from who.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.58,0:24:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 这是哥斯拉活跃的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever it is, this is why Godzilla's on the move?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.98,0:24:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还不能确定 但应该是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't say for sure. But it seems that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.31,0:24:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们得尽快搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we have to figure this out fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.88,0:24:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险已经迫在眉睫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wolves are already at our door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.18,0:24:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府一直在找各种借口 企图接手地心空洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The government has been looking for an excuse to take over Hollow Earth operations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.61,0:24:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,各大企业也都虎视眈眈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the corporations are licking their chops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.81,0:24:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也难怪 谁不想除掉这些怪兽 再发笔横财\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, because who wants to be rich and get rid of all the monsters?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.48,0:24:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是什么好事 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that'd be terrible, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.68,0:24:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好赶在政府之前找到信号源\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd better find the source before D.C. gets wind of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.01,0:24:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.18,0:24:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让你全权负责这次行动 带上几个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm giving you full operational oversight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.88,0:24:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,米凯尔 开快点 千万别死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a small team. Mikael, make it fast and don't let anyone die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.38,0:24:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们天黑之前就能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be in and out of there before nightfall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.54,0:24:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你要不要一起去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh, you feel like going for a ride?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.04,0:24:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭敬不如从命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you'd never ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.08,0:24:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,各部门人员请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, all hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.44,0:25:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟后发射地飞3号 请做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare HEAV three for Hollow Earth launch in T minus five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.51,0:25:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,地心空洞前哨站没有任何回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no response from the Hollow Earth outpost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.91,0:25:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是无线电坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their radios must be down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.29,0:25:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们先去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then that's our first stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.63,0:25:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.87,0:25:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}我想跟你一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.33,0:25:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，228）\1c&H00C0D9&}我说什么都不想让你去 下面太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.50,0:25:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}有东西在召唤我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.62,0:25:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}「你应该在我身边 我也应该在你身边」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.50,0:25:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}你要用我的话反驳我？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.67,0:25:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}不是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.95,0:25:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}再说了 你或许会需要我跟金刚交流
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.22,0:25:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,都打起精神来 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, wakey wakey, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.03,0:25:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,它醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kong's up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.60,0:25:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}你要时刻在我身边
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.99,0:25:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德鲁斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey! Doctor Andrews.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.76,0:26:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明明说好了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Come on, we had a deal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.19,0:26:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是去观光 是去执行侦查任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bernie, this isn't sightseeing. It's a reconnaissance mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.76,0:26:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I see how it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.19,0:26:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,要用我的时候就说\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you need something, it's all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.56,0:26:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真聪明 伯尼 你这么有本事 伯尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}"you're so smart, Bernie, you're so capable, Bernie, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.69,0:26:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会订阅你的播客 伯尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'll subscribe to your Titan blog, Bernie, "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.59,0:26:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我一弄完 你就把我丢一边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when I deliver it, you toss me aside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.44,0:26:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 其实 可能会有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look. This could be dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.68,0:26:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 危险再大 我也不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I'm no stranger to danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.18,0:26:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意押韵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to rhyme that time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.91,0:26:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠我人情好不好 我破解了这个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you owe me. Okay? I helped crack this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.04,0:26:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以像上次那样拯救世界 还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could be like last time, when we saved the world. Remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.00,0:26:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,米凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikael?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.04,0:26:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再准备一个座位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Prep a seat for one more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.71,0:26:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢安德鲁斯博士 你一定不会失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Doctor Andrews! You will not regret it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.88,0:26:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在逗我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.74,0:26:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是新来的 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the plus one. Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.14,0:26:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统上线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Systems online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.38,0:26:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.31,0:26:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去地心空洞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to Hollow Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.21,0:26:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去地心空洞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to Hollow Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.01,0:26:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我没做梦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. What am I doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.68,0:27:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐地飞有什么 我需要了解的注意事项吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is there, like, a in-flight briefing that I should know about? You know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.44,0:27:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.81,0:27:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他比较 这里没有降落伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's very… There's no parachutes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.11,0:27:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有什么漂浮装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}no flotation devices, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.16,0:27:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是敢碰屏幕 手就废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you touch any of this stuff, you lose your hand, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.98,0:27:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if you die, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.01,0:27:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,可别死在我的舱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}make sure it's outside my vehicle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.88,0:27:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good briefing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.68,0:27:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great briefing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.28,0:27:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别怪米凯尔 他是爱之深责之切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take Mikael too personally. Aggression is his love language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.09,0:27:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 米凯尔 我们出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Mikael. Let's punch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.59,0:27:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,地飞1号 可以起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}HEAV one, you are clear for launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.39,0:27:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.56,0:27:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好别把舌头咽下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just try not to swallow your tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.59,0:27:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.59,0:27:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好别把舌头咽下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try not to swallow my tongue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.89,0:28:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't exactly know what that means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.63,0:28:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地呼叫地飞 准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Base to HEAV, you're clear for entry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.36,0:28:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德鲁斯博士 请倒计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your count, Doctor Andrews{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.16,0:28:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三 - 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Three. - All right, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.96,0:28:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 二 - 等等 我没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two. - I'm not ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.13,0:28:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一 - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And one. - Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.64,0:28:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要被…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.58,0:28:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,晃成水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}turning into water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.08,0:29:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行系统已上线 系统已稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flight systems active. Systems stabilized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.48,0:29:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统正常 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Systems stabilized. Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.94,0:29:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's everyone doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.14,0:29:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事吧 - 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Never better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.38,0:29:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.44,0:29:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯尼 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bernie, you good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.08,0:29:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.49,0:29:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来金刚要回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Kong is headed home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.53,0:29:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,离前哨站还有多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far to the outpost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.56,0:29:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百公里 他们还是没有回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hundred klicks. They're still not answering comms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.83,0:29:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,近距离警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proximity alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.83,0:29:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,9点钟方向有掠食鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Predators, nine o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.29,0:29:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.29,0:30:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是彩翼鸟 米凯尔 它们叫彩翼鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are vertacines, Mikael. They're called vertacines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.13,0:30:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们有威胁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, are they a problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.33,0:30:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 完全无害\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. They're totally harmless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.93,0:30:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非把它们惹恼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you get them riled up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.96,0:30:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就会发射生物电磁闪电攻击你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then they pack about a lightning bolt worth of bioelectricity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.26,0:30:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,掠食者懂得保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Predators know to stay well away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.26,0:30:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 如果能有酷炫的仿生学迷彩外观\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes them the perfect chaperone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.53,0:30:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会是完美的护卫队\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you happen to have a cool biomimicry camouflage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.56,0:30:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们真的有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.66,0:30:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.48,0:30:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.64,0:30:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉刚刚在法国登陆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla just made landfall in France.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.84,0:30:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,地面小队在它五公里之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ground team is five klicks out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.60,0:30:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（268，198）\1c&H26D4DF&}法国 蒙塔尼亚克
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.91,0:30:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}地面小队呼叫帝王组织…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.08,0:30:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}…我们在接近哥斯拉所在位置
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.51,0:30:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有画面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.73,0:31:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 这是一个核设施\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. It's a nuclear facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.57,0:31:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}核反应堆被破坏了！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.25,0:31:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}整个区域都受到了核辐射！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.08,0:31:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}快撤退 撤退！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.04,0:31:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,大气辐射量在降低\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atmospheric radiation levels{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.84,0:31:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在吸收核辐射\N{\fnArial\fs30}are dropping. He's absorbing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.68,0:31:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 它在补充能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, he's charging for something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.23,0:32:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉吸收了大量核辐射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla consumed a huge amount of radiation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.80,0:32:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,它肯定在为什么做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is clearly preparing for something…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.13,0:32:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,超出范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.26,0:32:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.23,0:32:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上到达1号前哨站\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming up on Outpost One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.69,0:32:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.76,0:32:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这看起来可不太妙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, now. That doesn't look good now, does it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.96,0:32:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,能看到吗 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seeing this, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.28,0:32:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I'm seeing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.34,0:33:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有热感信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's no heat signatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.78,0:33:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕全死光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.64,0:33:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,放尊重点 他们也有家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, have some respect. These people had families.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.48,0:33:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么东西干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could have done this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.92,0:33:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.74,0:33:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个前哨站这么多年都安然无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've had this outpost for years without incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.98,0:33:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么现在被毁了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why attack now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.94,0:33:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What changed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.88,0:33:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 这里有个摄像机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Doc. There's a camera here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.04,0:33:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得能 调出什么画面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You reckon you can pull any footage off of that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.94,0:33:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.94,0:33:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是金刚干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Kong did that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.04,0:33:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是它 是别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not Kong. That's something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.54,0:33:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.11,0:33:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧走吧 趁着那个东西还没回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get off the ground before that something else comes back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.08,0:33:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saddle up. Let's hustle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.18,0:35:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（245，125）\1c&H26D4DF&}地下 未知区域
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.36,0:38:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西上面有什么线索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you getting anything off that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.02,0:39:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.03,0:39:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.46,0:39:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.51,0:39:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.09,0:39:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.93,0:39:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着像是一头猿 但这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like an ape. But that's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.49,0:39:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the bloody hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.76,0:39:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.28,0:39:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 米凯尔 米凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Mikael! Mikael!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.98,0:39:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在处理呢 给力点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it! Come on, you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.48,0:39:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 好吧 好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! Okay, okay, okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.73,0:39:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况 米凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell was that, Mikael?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.15,0:39:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,淡定 淡定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down. Calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.17,0:39:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是因为那个信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must've been the signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.15,0:39:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,前哨站受到了同样的电子干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same electrical disturbances were happening at the outpost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.52,0:39:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行系统已稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.78,0:39:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}信号越来越强了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.25,0:39:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.98,0:39:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}是从那一带发出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.92,0:39:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（193，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}你确定…？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.61,0:39:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说是从山脊那边发出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says it's coming from that ridge point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.98,0:39:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们过去看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's take a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.34,0:39:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽量靠得近一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get as close as I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.11,0:40:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,地心空洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hollow Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.34,0:40:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个没有被人类影响过的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A world untouched by mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.98,0:40:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当年尼尔·阿姆斯特朗踏上外星表面的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this how Neil Armstrong felt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.51,0:40:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这种感受吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he stepped on alien soil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.71,0:40:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.74,0:40:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我个人的一小步 却是人类的一大步…\N{\fnArial\fs30}one small step for me, and one giant leap for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.84,0:40:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你跟谁说话呢 - 你搞笑呢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you talking to? - Are you kidding me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.36,0:40:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看到镜头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right down the lens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.39,0:40:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拍纪录片呢 你得自然点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a documentary. You wanna be natural.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.29,0:40:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,往前走 你就往前走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just walk, if you just walk. All right, just keep…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.13,0:40:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 好 第二条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just… Okay. Take two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.13,0:40:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,地心空洞 一个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hollow Earth. A world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.59,0:40:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.56,0:40:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说的那道山脊在正前方大约3.2公里以外\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ridge you pointed out is about two miles straight ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.19,0:40:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕是要被活活吃掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting eaten alive out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.33,0:40:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.76,0:40:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的血肯定也好喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must be tasty too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.86,0:40:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄死它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.19,0:41:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有母蚊子才吸血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only female mosquitos drink blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.99,0:41:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样它们才能产卵\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they can grow their eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.93,0:41:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它比我更需要血\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs it more than me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.66,0:41:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.86,0:41:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.23,0:41:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the holdup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.69,0:41:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.28,0:41:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.74,0:41:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得绕开这里 这里不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we gotta take a detour. There's something here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.51,0:41:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里指的是哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where, here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.64,0:41:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like here, here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.04,0:41:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 仪器什么都没感应到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. I'm not picking anything up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.04,0:41:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这里味儿不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Something doesn't smell right, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.44,0:41:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是你身上的味儿 米凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's not just you, Mikael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.04,0:41:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻到了吗 像是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you smell that? It's like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.71,0:41:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,像腐肉的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}rotting flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.14,0:41:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能上风地带有动物尸体吧 继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably just a carcass upwind. We keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.74,0:41:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,米凯尔 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikael, hold up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.44,0:41:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, pal. I'm gonna trust{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.61,0:41:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更相信自己先进的热感仪\N{\fnArial\fs30}my state of the art thermal over your{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.64,0:41:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是你那不着调的嬉皮士第六感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ace Ventura hippie-dippie sixth sense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.94,0:41:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}all day long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.48,0:41:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.11,0:42:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有必要骂人吧 我们就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need to call people names. We're just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.41,0:42:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你 怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. And as for you, freak show, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.78,0:42:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是不给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you don't shut it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.98,0:42:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就用那台摄像机好好招呼你的屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take that camera, I'm gonna shove it right up your arse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.48,0:42:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in charge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.48,0:42:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}we move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.08,0:42:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不听更冷静的人的意见呢 米凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we just listen to somebody calmer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.61,0:42:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你感觉到 都说了 我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I'm in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.08,0:42:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in charge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.91,0:42:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.58,0:42:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被树吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.94,0:42:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 等一下 - 他被树吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, wait, wait. - It was a tree!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.28,0:42:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该没事了 应该没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be all right. We should be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.84,0:42:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种东西跑不了这么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those things don't reach that far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.21,0:42:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被树给吃掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was just eaten by a tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.68,0:42:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you doing, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.51,0:42:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝试呼叫基地 准备撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to call the Base for extraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.84,0:42:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 他前一秒还在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just, one minute he was there, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.88,0:42:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就杵在我面前 然后那裸树 突然就\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was right in my face. And then, a tree!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.04,0:42:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 兄弟 我懂 这事很沉重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outta nowhere! I know, man. I know. That's heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.54,0:42:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但自然界就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's the natural world, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.84,0:42:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,「爪牙染满了血」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Red in tooth and claw."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.83,0:42:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,丁尼生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tennyson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.29,0:42:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚眼看着一个活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just watched a man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.76,0:42:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,被树雕怪吃了 还有心情引用丁尼生的诗\N{\fnArial\fs30}get devoured by a topiary nightmare, and you want to quote Tennyson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.73,0:42:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这地底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.59,0:42:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.43,0:42:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他写的是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew all about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.76,0:42:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让爱紧抓住悲痛 兄弟 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Let love clasp grief, " man. Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.23,0:42:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们人类总以为自己已经不在食物链里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, humans, we think we took ourselves off the food chain, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.33,0:42:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.96,0:42:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.93,0:42:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许泰坦巨兽就是来提醒我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe the Titans are here to remind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.56,0:43:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你这个人挺有毛病的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that there is something seriously wrong with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.46,0:43:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Mm-kay. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.79,0:43:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,联络不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.39,0:43:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}We better move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.93,0:43:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头再哀悼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll mourn later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.79,0:43:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉雅 走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jia. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.09,0:43:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, bud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.79,0:43:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 他被一棵树吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was eaten by a tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.96,0:43:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想那么死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't… I don't want to die like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.89,0:43:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想被树吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not by a tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.81,0:43:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（65，108）\1c&H26D4DF&}西班牙 加的斯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.49,0:43:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔台 我们没法再靠近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tower, we can't get any closer than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.02,0:43:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉身上带着辐射 体温很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla's burning hot with radiation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.83,0:43:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西把它给惹恼了 它要往那里赶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever he's headed for has him really pissed off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.41,0:43:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地呼叫15A潜艇 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Base calling Fifteen Alpha, over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.41,0:43:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是15A\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen Alpha responding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.01,0:43:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉目前的行动轨迹表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla's current trajectory is showing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.55,0:44:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它正在前往北冰洋\N{\fnArial\fs30}him heading towards the Arctic Ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.59,0:44:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那片区域都有哪些巨兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}What Titans are in the area?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.51,0:44:04.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（克维托亚岛）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.54,0:44:06.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（克维托亚岛 侦测到泰坦巨兽019）
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.30,0:44:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来它是冲提亚马特去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he's hunting Tiamat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.51,0:44:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,机密文件324\N{\fnArial\fs30}Classified file three two four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.63,0:44:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰坦巨兽提亚马特 19号巨兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Titanus Tiamat. Titan nineteen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.91,0:44:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,极具攻击性 有领地意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extremely aggressive, territorial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.68,0:44:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,身上覆有锋利的鳞片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weaponizing her body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.38,0:44:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,令它如虎添翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}of razor-sharp scales…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.51,0:44:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,提亚马特的北极巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiamat's Arctic lair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.00,0:44:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,位于电磁太阳风的直接路径上\N{\fnArial\fs30}sits in the direct path of electromagnetically charged solar winds, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.04,0:44:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也因此成为了地球上最大的能源储备库\N{\fnArial\fs30}making it the largest stockpile of energy on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.81,0:44:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果哥斯拉打倒了提亚马特\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Godzilla takes down Tiamat, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.84,0:44:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会进行超级充能\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll supercharge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.94,0:44:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是遗迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ruins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.84,0:44:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类文明？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human civilization?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.64,0:44:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.23,0:44:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}这是我们族人的符号！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.06,0:44:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.29,0:44:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些刻文的年头\N{\fnArial\fs30}The markings are older than the ones{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.46,0:45:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,比骷髅岛上那些早了很多个世纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}on Skull Island. Centuries older.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.99,0:45:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这座建筑和伊维族的建筑一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the architecture is consistent with the Iwi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.36,0:45:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}他们怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.86,0:45:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is remarkable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.23,0:45:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.94,0:45:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些台阶上没有苔藓\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no moss on these ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.84,0:46:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.51,0:46:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩斯拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mothra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.08,0:46:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,地心空洞的 怪兽女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen of the monsters. In Hollow Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.34,0:46:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的起源时间一定比我们想象的要久远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her lineage must go back further than we thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.32,0:46:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}这里曾经是一座神庙…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.02,0:46:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}…是祭拜的场所
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.90,0:46:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.92,0:46:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.12,0:46:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.73,0:47:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着像是灌溉系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like some kind of a irrigation system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.93,0:47:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过它是问世最早的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only this predates everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.80,0:47:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么美索不达米亚文明 利莫里亚文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mesopotamians, the Lemurians…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.93,0:47:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们这里才是最早的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, these guys were the first, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.23,0:47:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉雅 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.90,0:47:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,水还在往前流呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just keeps going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.27,0:47:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.57,0:47:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.43,0:47:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, whoa. What the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.77,0:47:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这趟真是值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that is a trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.20,0:47:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊世大发现 你们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great Mulder and Scully, look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.87,0:47:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么创造了它呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could have created this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.03,0:47:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,远古外星宇航员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ancient alien astronauts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.20,0:47:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.60,0:47:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,水在下面流\N{\fnArial\fs30}The water's running underneath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.53,0:47:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这个是有机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is organic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.41,0:47:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.70,0:48:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是什么生物电站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of bioelectric hub.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.98,0:48:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,像一层伪装\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like camouflage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.88,0:48:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是该这么干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should she be doing that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.32,0:48:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是不该这么干啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She shouldn't be doing that, right? Should she…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.82,0:48:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}跟我梦里的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.27,0:48:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肯定就是信号源了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This must be the source of the signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.80,0:48:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可得好好瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we've gotta check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.40,0:48:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.07,0:48:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 走吧 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Go, go, go. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.58,0:53:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（119，220）\1c&H26D4DF&}北冰洋 提亚玛特的领地
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.96,0:53:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,15A报告基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen Alpha reporting to base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.91,0:53:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在进入提亚马特的领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're entering Tiamat's domain, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.48,0:53:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况有些异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}but something is off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.15,0:53:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,提亚马特的能量把我们的雷达弄失真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiamat's energy is distorting our radar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.81,0:53:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在看不到哥斯拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a visual on Godzilla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.35,0:53:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,向前行进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us forward, silent running…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.31,0:53:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 静音潜航 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- silent running… - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.81,0:53:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,航速五节\N{\fnArial\fs30}five knots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.65,0:53:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,求救 快撤出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayday! Get that out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.26,0:54:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快撤出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.93,0:54:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要状态报告 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need a status report! - That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.53,0:54:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它进了提亚马特的巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone to Tiamat's lair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.73,0:55:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.76,0:55:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what did she say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.10,0:55:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说这里不只有我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says we're not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.50,0:55:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? I knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.73,0:55:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就觉得这里有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I felt something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.13,0:55:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.50,0:55:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.76,0:55:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.90,0:55:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 天啊 - 我马上收 我马上收\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. Oh, my God. - It's going away. It's going away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.76,0:55:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.58,0:56:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.11,0:56:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.68,0:56:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.21,0:56:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个在地心空洞里保存完好的伊维文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an entire Iwi civilization, protected within Hollow Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.28,0:56:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子 这些建筑都是用\N{\fnArial\fs30}These structures, they look like they've been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.88,0:56:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨大的石英晶体雕凿而成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}carved from some enormous quartz crystal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.55,0:56:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那肯定是他们的能量源\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must be their energy source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.58,0:56:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感受到能量了 但你控制下情绪好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm feeling the energy, but let's just keep it together, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.18,0:56:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}我能感知他们的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.46,0:56:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.20,0:56:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是 一个没有被记录在案的涡旋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an undocumented vortex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.13,0:56:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子是有好几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like several of them, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.20,0:56:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,通往地表的通道 可能会通在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Routes to the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.53,0:57:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上的任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}These could lead all over the Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.36,0:57:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,太神奇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wow. That's incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.86,0:57:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要和他们用眼神交流 这样才礼貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should make eye contact with them. It's considered polite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.36,0:57:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 这样弄得我很不自在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is not working for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.76,0:57:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是怎么沟通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are they communicating?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.76,0:57:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过心灵感应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Telepathically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.46,0:57:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.30,0:57:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.53,0:57:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能带她走 - 感觉她要带她去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't take her. - I think she's taking her to the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.48,0:57:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那让我去吧 我们不反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let me come! Hey! Hey! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.71,0:57:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不反抗 - 等一下 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on, okay, we're not resisting. - Wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.48,0:57:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 让我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this, let me go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.31,0:57:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道她要带她去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where she's taking her! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.43,0:58:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.85,0:58:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.63,0:59:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 走吧 - 走 走 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, come on. Okay. - Let's go, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.70,0:59:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能不能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.66,0:59:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.63,0:59:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}这里就是信号源
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.60,0:59:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.56,0:59:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说什么 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's she saying, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.73,0:59:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个我们一直在追踪的信号 其实…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beacon that we've been following, it's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.86,0:59:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是伊维人在呼救\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Iwi calling for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.26,0:59:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.10,0:59:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 他们发了求救信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, wait. They send out this SOS, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.96,1:00:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.26,1:00:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla hears it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.78,1:00:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.83,1:00:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们唤醒了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}They woke him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.00,1:00:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,发求救信号干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}An SOS for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.83,1:00:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经活在一个噩梦般的怪兽环境里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They already live in a nightmare monster hellscape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.95,1:00:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么能吓到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could possibly scare them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.18,1:00:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的话她都听得懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. She can understand everything that you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.41,1:00:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她懂我的话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She understands me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.68,1:00:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.95,1:00:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 这种噩梦般的怪兽环境呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a nightmare monster hellscape{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.75,1:00:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个生养子女的好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a wonderful place to raise a family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.36,1:01:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个房间里都是伊维人的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole room is covered in Iwi script.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.13,1:01:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.16,1:01:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一开始 地心空洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the beginning, Hollow Earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.55,1:01:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾与地表世界和谐共处\N{\fnArial\fs30}lived in harmony with the surface world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.93,1:01:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰坦巨兽是自然界的守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Titans were the guardians of nature{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.33,1:01:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而巨猿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Great Apes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.46,1:01:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,则是成为了整个人类族群的守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}became the protectors of humanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.93,1:01:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一股巨大的邪恶力量威胁到了和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a great evil threatened the peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.16,1:01:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一头强大而残暴的猿\N{\fnArial\fs30}A powerful and ruthless ape{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.50,1:01:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,迫切想要征服地表世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}desperate to conquer the surface world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.76,1:01:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它带领自己的部落开了战\N{\fnArial\fs30}led his tribe into war{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.46,1:01:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对手就是伊维族所说的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}against the one they call…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.90,1:01:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,吞星怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Monster Who Ate a Star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.40,1:01:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.33,1:02:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.56,1:02:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉险些在与众猿的战斗中丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The war with the Apes nearly destroyed Godzilla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.80,1:02:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在一场大战之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after a great battle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.73,1:02:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,它把众猿囚禁在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he imprisoned the apes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.83,1:02:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,地心空洞的一片炽热之地里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a fiery realm of Hollow Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.10,1:02:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个冒牌的猿中王者仍然一心想要上地表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their false king remains obsessed with reaching the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.40,1:02:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊维人叫它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Iwi call him the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.30,1:02:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀疤王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skar King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.13,1:10:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,困在地下的刀疤王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trapped within their subterranean realm, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.56,1:10:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,驯服了一个可怕的帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Skar King harnessed a terrible power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.33,1:10:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,远古泰坦巨兽 雪魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ancient Titan, Shimo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.26,1:10:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它用痛苦控制雪魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He controls her with pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.26,1:10:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪魔的力量曾在上一个冰期威震整个地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her power covered the Earth in the last ice age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.76,1:10:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把金刚送了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We brought Kong down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.76,1:10:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一直在寻找同类 深入地心空洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been looking for others like himself, going deeper into Hollow Earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.23,1:10:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也离那座囚笼越来越近\N{\fnArial\fs30}and getting closer to their prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.46,1:10:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊维人一定知道金刚迟早会找过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Iwi must have known it was just a matter of time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.46,1:10:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们一直在呼救\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's why they've been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.06,1:10:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是哥斯拉要进化的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}calling for help, and that's why Godzilla's changing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.66,1:10:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在为第三次世界大战做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gearing up for World War Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.06,1:10:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 可哥斯拉上回勉强捡了条命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but he barely survived last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.46,1:10:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次它孤军奋战 又能如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Godzilla gonna do on his own?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.96,1:10:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不会孤军奋战的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't be on his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.83,1:10:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊维人认为 在世界末日来临之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Iwi believe that at the end of the world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.86,1:10:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的一个族人会归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of their own will return…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.53,1:10:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,并唤醒摩斯拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and awaken Mothra, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.96,1:10:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是伊维族的捍卫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}defender of the Iwi…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.80,1:10:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是哥斯拉的古老盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ancient ally of Godzilla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.56,1:11:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊维人相信 他们的救世主\N{\fnArial\fs30}They believe that their savior will be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.75,1:11:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,会是一个来自骷髅岛的伊维人\N{\fnArial\fs30}an Iwi from Skull Island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.71,1:11:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还是个孩子 就要承担这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That seems like a lot to put on one kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.55,1:13:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝王组织空中小队呼叫基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Monarch Air Team to Base, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.05,1:13:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在追踪哥斯拉的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}tracking over Godzilla's location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.25,1:13:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经关闭了480公里内的航道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've closed the shipping lanes within 300 miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.18,1:13:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,等离子体读数显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plasma readings indicate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.55,1:13:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,它正在吸收里面的所有能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's absorbing everything in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.35,1:13:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚收养她的时候 发过一个誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I made a deal with myself when I became a mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.85,1:13:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么告诉自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said to myself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.15,1:13:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你今后要牺牲什么 或者是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what you have to sacrifice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.71,1:13:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you have to give up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.48,1:14:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都一定要对那个小姑娘好\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will do right by that little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.98,1:14:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没有想过 我要放弃的会是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just never thought that the thing I'd be giving up would be her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.01,1:14:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还说不好呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you don't know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.48,1:14:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.81,1:14:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,特雷普 我们来这里之前 她说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trapper, before we came here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.21,1:14:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己不属于任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}she said that she didn't belong anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.71,1:14:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是她想要的生活 我就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is the life that she wants…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.90,1:14:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得不放手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I have to give her up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.83,1:14:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我犯晕了 还是这里的一切都变轻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I having a funny turn or does everything feel lighter down here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.80,1:14:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先给我蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Bernie mumbles incoherently]{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.63,1:14:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 等一下 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.63,1:14:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们这是干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.83,1:14:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意儿肯定沉死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must weigh a ton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.99,1:14:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.63,1:14:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我也不知道他们是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, see, I don't know how they can do it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.09,1:14:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们有办法移动金字塔的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}but somehow they're able to move the pyramids' positions, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.73,1:14:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,从而扰乱这里的地心引力\N{\fnArial\fs30}which disrupts the gravitational pull down here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.93,1:14:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是这样让城市运作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's how they run their city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.63,1:14:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个文明都建立在操控地心引力的基础上\N{\fnArial\fs30}An entire civilization built off the manipulation of gravity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.06,1:14:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呢 真希望这是在直播\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I wish was streaming this live!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.43,1:15:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么处理视频 伯尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you gonna do with that, Bern?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.46,1:15:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在想什么 可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know what you're thinking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.76,1:15:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不懂 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you don't understand. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.90,1:15:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些事明明都是我亲身经历或亲眼所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}To have been through what I've been through, seen what I seen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.20,1:15:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,却根本没有人相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have absolutely nobody believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.06,1:15:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方 这个地方真的很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place… This place is special, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.20,1:15:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.26,1:15:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得 如果你把视频发到网上\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do you think it'll stay like that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.70,1:15:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种状态还能维持多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you start posting that about, hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.20,1:15:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看那些与世隔绝的部落或社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, you look at any isolated tribe or community, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.75,1:15:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少能在接触了外界以后留存下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}how many of them urvive contact with the outside world, hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.81,1:15:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我觉得你可捧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I think you're brilliant, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.11,1:15:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经拯救过一次世界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already saved the world once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.98,1:15:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这功劳没人抢得走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't take that away from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.71,1:15:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you say that all again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.18,1:15:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后这一段 我好录下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last part, so I have it on footage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.21,1:15:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.98,1:15:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定得去看看那是什么 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, we have to find out what that was, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.35,1:16:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.53,1:16:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一头迷你金刚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a mini-Kong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.43,1:16:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是怎么找到这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did they find this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.00,1:16:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一定是感知到了吉雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have sensed Jia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.05,1:17:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}我没有家了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.01,1:17:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条胳膊伤得很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}That arm looks bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.18,1:17:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 简直糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's worse than bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.51,1:17:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是冻伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's frostbite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.61,1:17:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最好过去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd better go take a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.93,1:19:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 侦测到能量信号改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning, detecting altered energy signature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.45,1:19:24.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（皮肤 肌肉密度增加 体温可调节）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.33,1:19:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 它进化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. He's changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.96,1:19:26.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（背鳍 能量储备增加20倍）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.86,1:19:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道 没有人喜欢牙医\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know. Nobody likes a dentist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.56,1:19:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就过来看看你的胳膊 大块头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get a look at that arm, big guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.73,1:19:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,特雷普 它看起来很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trapper, he looks really hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.56,1:19:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 它状况很不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's not great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.18,1:19:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了神经损伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm seeing nerve damage…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.05,1:19:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有大面积的组织损伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}significant tissue loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.24,1:19:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.61,1:19:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一条胳膊的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna last{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.61,1:19:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在这里连一天都活不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a day down here with only one arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.01,1:19:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我们现在还是联系不上地面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, communication to the surface is still out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.78,1:20:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能返回前哨站\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can get back to the outpost, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.18,1:20:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定那里会有我们用得上的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there might be some supplies that we can use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.41,1:20:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕一块大石膏解决不了问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think a massive cast is gonna solve the problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.75,1:20:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没说要去那里弄熟石膏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't talking plaster of Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.65,1:20:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在主要在想的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking more along the lines of, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.01,1:20:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,动力室项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project Powerhouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.58,1:20:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.91,1:20:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认真极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm deadly serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.08,1:20:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,样机在他们撤资的时候就已经基本做好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That prototype was almost finished when they pulled the funding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.35,1:20:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那你还待在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, what are you still doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.31,1:20:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, too, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.75,1:20:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,动力室项目 这 这具体是个什么项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project Powerhouse, what is… what is that, exactly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.51,1:20:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,机械哥斯拉出现后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Mechagodzilla, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.88,1:20:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们意识到有些威胁就连金刚都对付不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we realized that there were some threats that even Kong couldn't face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.21,1:20:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.75,1:20:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就开始着手 做些小小的改进\N{\fnArial\fs30}we started working on some minor augmentations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.28,1:20:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 是什么样的改进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what kind of augmentations?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.88,1:20:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,让最强大的泰坦巨兽变得更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making one of the strongest Titans{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.35,1:20:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这想法不是很得人心\N{\fnArial\fs30}even stronger didn't go over so well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.31,1:20:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们的项目被叫停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we got shut down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.56,1:21:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好在样机已经被送到了地心空洞进行测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for us, the prototype had already been transported to Hollow Earth for testing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.86,1:21:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就存放在1号前哨站的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stored{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.93,1:21:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,军械库里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the armory at Outpost One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.68,1:21:21.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（释放载荷）
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.81,1:21:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动驾驶启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Autopilot engaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.72,1:21:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think of that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.11,1:21:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这改进可是相当地厉害 特雷普\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one hell of an augmentation there, Trapper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.58,1:21:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只给金刚先生用最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the best for Mr. Kong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.96,1:22:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 就要开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, it's ready to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.05,1:22:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些注射药物应该能有效治疗冻伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those injections should heal the frostbite up nicely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.35,1:22:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 起效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, there he goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.18,1:22:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,它动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.88,1:22:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.91,1:22:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意儿有点粗糙 但应该也不会掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's a bit rough and ready, but it should hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.68,1:22:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好 看着挺好 特雷普\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good. It looks good, Trapper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.01,1:22:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.08,1:23:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来看看效果 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here we go. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.06,1:23:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,金刚要么会特别喜欢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's either gonna love it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.36,1:23:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么会用牙把它扯掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}or he's gonna rip it off with his teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.08,1:23:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉金刚喜欢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he loves it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.86,1:23:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.40,1:23:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀疤王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skar King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.00,1:23:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟它说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey! What did you tell him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.12,1:23:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}我说 我们需要帮助
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.70,1:23:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's he going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.50,1:23:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉是不会下来的 除非金刚带它来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla won't come down here unless Kong brings him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.97,1:23:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 它们上次碰面的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, the last time those two met up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.36,1:23:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,金刚差点没命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was almost the end of Kong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.13,1:24:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在冒很大的风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is taking a hell of a risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.03,1:24:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果金刚入侵它的领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Kong invades his turf, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.66,1:24:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会引发战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}could start a war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.03,1:24:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 简直是在自投罗网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's a suicide mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.46,1:24:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果金刚能把哥斯拉带到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if Kong draws Godzilla down here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.01,1:24:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们就可以在地心空洞联手抗敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can make their stand in Hollow Earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.18,1:24:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then there's a chance that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.28,1:24:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉就有机会阻止刀疤王和雪魔前往地表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla can stop Skar King and Shimo from reaching the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.97,1:24:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（86，283）\1c&H33D0DB&}埃及 开罗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.20,1:24:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.00,1:24:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看那里
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.66,1:25:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（284，95）\1c&H26D4DF&}直布罗陀
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.20,1:26:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说 真的确定吉雅能把这事给办成吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are absolutely certain that she can pull this off, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.31,1:26:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是因为这个才被召唤来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why Jia was called here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.18,1:26:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个来自骷髅岛的伊维人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only an Iwi from Skull Island can awaken Mothra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.35,1:26:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以唤醒摩斯拉 而摩斯拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mothra is the key to Godzilla{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.85,1:26:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是让哥斯拉保护这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}protecting this place, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.58,1:26:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护通往地表通道的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}and its pathways to the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.71,1:26:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会有事的 她不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna be all right. She's gonna be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.90,1:27:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在让村民们撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, she's evacuating the villagers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.50,1:27:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,重力 重力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gravity! Gravity!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.16,1:27:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,金字塔和重力 我明白了 这下明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pyramids and gravity. Yeah, I got it! I got it now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.42,1:27:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 路上跟我解释 - 快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me on the way. - Come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.16,1:28:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们纯粹是在碰运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}While we are throwing random shit at the wall, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.36,1:28:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我能不能开着地飞去 搬点救兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}permission to take the HEAV? Rally some reinforcements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.36,1:28:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,去地面上吗 不行 没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the surface? No, there's no time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.00,1:28:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我的想法可离谱多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this idea's way weirder than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.81,1:31:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们在金字塔下面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're underneath the pyramids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.85,1:31:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,解释一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.25,1:31:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,重力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gravity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.91,1:31:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊维族的技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iwi technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.33,1:31:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生化学反应后\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the chemical reaction, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.43,1:32:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种液态金属会形成一种工程机制\N{\fnArial\fs30}this liquid metal becomes an engineering mechanism{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.13,1:32:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,推动这两座电磁金字塔聚合到一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}forcing the two electromagnetic pyramids{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.93,1:32:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,产生一道反重力冲击波\N{\fnArial\fs30}together, causing an anti-gravity shock wave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.93,1:32:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它只能维持几分钟 或许会更短\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only for a few minutes. Or maybe less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.46,1:32:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样可以不让那些东西靠近传送口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which should keep those things from the portals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.93,1:32:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之后 所有在上面的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that, everything that is up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.13,1:32:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会砸下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}will come crashing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.00,1:32:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.05,1:33:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赶不上了 来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna make it. There's not enough time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.20,1:33:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,得想办法拖住它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need something to slow them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.55,1:33:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 可我们还能怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but what else can we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.95,1:33:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是彩翼鸟交配季\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's vertacine mating season.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.85,1:33:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.18,1:33:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭请各位上座\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your carriage awaits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.01,1:33:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要跟你亲个嘴 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna kiss you on the mouth! - Come on. Go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.08,1:33:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 系好安全带 帅哥美女们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buckle up, you beautiful people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.35,1:33:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,起飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up and away. Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.73,1:34:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 引擎失效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! The engine's out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.10,1:34:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,重力冲击波一定损坏了机上的什么能量电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gravity surge must have taken out the power-battery-thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.25,1:35:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.21,1:35:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在保护那些传送口\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's protecting the portals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.80,1:36:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.58,1:37:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（105，237）\1c&H33D0DB&}巴西 里约热内卢
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.23,1:43:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.73,1:43:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉雅 你没事 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jia, you're safe! Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.43,1:44:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}我太为你骄傲了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.21,1:44:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.83,1:44:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}我知道 这个地方…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.45,1:44:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}…让你有家的感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.75,1:44:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}我就是想让你知道
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.07,1:44:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}不论你怎么决定
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.00,1:44:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}我都支持
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.88,1:44:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}你在说什么呀
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.74,1:44:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What am I talking a…"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.71,1:44:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}我以为你想留在地心
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.01,1:44:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}不论我们去哪里 去做什么…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.28,1:44:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos（192，252）\1c&H00C0D9&}…都要在一起
